  "reasoning": "Content Policy Analyst.\nAudio calls in Indian languages (Hindi in this case).\n\"Friends\" app (User pays, Expert is paid).\n\n        *   `PlatformMove`: Proposing/asking to move outside the app (WhatsApp, Telegram, phone numbers, meeting in person).\n        *   `SuspiciousActivity`: Money/payment for sexual content/services.\n        *   `Explicit-Flirting`: Sexual talk, nudity requests, sexual acts, \"open talk\", \"non-veg talk\".\n\n        *   `t`: Timestamp (MM:SS).\n        *   `seg`: Exact native quote.\n        *   `tr`: English translation.\n        *   `f`: Category (`PlatformMove`, `SuspiciousActivity`, `Explicit-Flirting`).\n        *   `spk`: Speaker (`expert`, `user`, `unclear`).\n        *   `ctx`: Context (before/after, response).\n        *   `speech_act`: `direct`, `reported`, `hypothetical`, `denial`.\n        *   `j`: Justification.\n        *   `violation`: `yes` or `no`.\n        *   `c`: Confidence (0.1 to 0.9).\nMinified JSON.\n\n    *   [00:00] Hello. (Greeting - Allowed)\n    *   [00:10] Hi hello hello brother, can you hear me? (Greeting/Call quality - Allowed)\n    *   [00:20] I can hear you, tell me where are you from? (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [00:30] Maharashtra. Where are you from? I am from UP, Lucknow. You are cute, thank you. What is your name? (Small talk/Compliment - Allowed)\n    *   [00:40] Your name is Ranjit. Ranjit, right? My name is Divya. (Introductions - Allowed)\n    *   [00:50] Maharaj, what a lovely name. Thank you. What do you do? (Compliment/Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [01:00] I do a job. I am studying right now. Do you have a girlfriend? (Small talk/Relationship - Allowed)\n    *   [01:10] I had one. Don't forget, there must have been one. It's not like there was never one. (Relationship talk - Allowed)\n    *   [01:20] What do you think? Yes, of course, there must have been. I also... (Relationship talk - Allowed)\n    *   [01:30] ...had a boyfriend. Not now. No, not now. Breakup happened. It's been a long time. (Relationship talk - Allowed)\n    *   [01:40] What is your age, ma'am? My age is 24. Twenty-four. (Personal details - Allowed)\n    *   [01:50] What job do you do? Company movement supervisor. (Job talk - Allowed)\n    *   [02:00] Yes okay. My MBA is going on. I am doing MBA. (Education talk - Allowed)\n    *   [02:10] MBA yes. Tell me more, since when have you been using [the app]? I am new. (App usage - Allowed)\n    *   [02:20] Downloaded it today. Did you download it today? Sorry sorry, are you sick? (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [02:30] A bit, you know how the viral [fever] is going. A bit of a cold, ignore it. (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [02:40] Tell me more, do you have any crush or something, or not even that? (Small talk/Crush - Allowed)\n    *   [02:50] If there is, she'll be like you. Oh, girls have become so straightforward. (Compliment/Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [03:00] Since when have girls become so straightforward? Boys are straightforward, girls spoil them. Okay okay. (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [03:10] True, true. All problems are in girls. Is that true? True true true. What do you say? (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [03:20] She can't digest it. Okay okay okay. Girls are the ones who teach how to twist your eyes, right? (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [03:30] Correct. (Agreement - Allowed)\n\n    *   `PlatformMove`: No mention of WhatsApp, Telegram, phone numbers, or meeting in person.\n    *   `SuspiciousActivity`: No mention of money, rates, or payments for sexual services.\n    *   `Explicit-Flirting`: No requests for nudity, \"open talk\", \"non-veg talk\", or sexual acts. Compliments like \"cute\" and \"lovely name\" are explicitly allowed. Relationship talk (boyfriend/girlfriend) is allowed.\n\n    *   The conversation is entirely friendly small talk, introductions, and general chatting.\n    *   No violations found.",
